      "closedForm": "Revenue per share 5 at price 45 implies P/S 9; x = (4/9) x (1.6/1.25)^2 = (4/9) x (32/25)^2 = 4096/5625. sqrt(x) = (2/3) x (32/25) = 64/75, so cagr = 64/75 - 1 = -11/75.",
      "intermediates": {
        "futureRevenue": 256000000,
        "futureNetIncome": 0,
